      "content": "but probabilities arent enough though. it feels more like a pattern. like, i see the way they all started to unravel, the same symptoms, the same way they just... stopped being able to cope. when you see the blueprint for your own collapse, \"meaningful goals\" just feel like distractions. how do you even fight your own biology? it feels like fighting the tide.",
