      "content": "it's not even worth expressing. if the outcome is already decided, then talking about it is just more noise. if everything is just a sequence of biological events that leads to the same breaking point, then there's no actual \"choice\" in the matter, is there? it just feels like i'm playing out a script that was written long before i was even born.",
